              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1040,
              "content": "The closest structural mirror of the phone. Row one is the mobile top bar unrolled: workspace switcher on the left, search in the middle, account on the right. Row two is the mobile tab bar turned horizontal — the same ordered views, the same overflow into “More”, just with room for six before it spills. Collections and saved views sit at the right end of the tab row. Nothing is stacked in a sidebar, so the full 1440 stays with the content.",
