              "fill": "$--text-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1040,
              "content": "Chrome shrinks to a 60px icon rail so the library gets almost the whole viewport. Everything the rail cannot label is reachable through two overlays: the rail expands over the content on hover for labels, reordering, collections and saved views, and workspace switching gets its own centred modal where each workspace is a card that shows what is inside it before you commit.",
