              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1040,
              "content": "A 264px persistent sidebar scoped to the active workspace. Views live in one flat reorderable list with the mobile tab-bar cutoff marked inline, since view order is shared with the phone. Collections and saved views are shared across every workspace, so they sit in their own region below a hard break instead of nesting inside the workspace. The workspace switcher is a header dropdown, which scales as users create their own workspaces.",
